WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.251
What’s your home really worth?

00:00:02.451 --> 00:00:05.250
An appraisal gives you an independent answer.

00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:14.059
People get one to refinance, to buy out a co-owner, to settle an estate or a separation, or to set a price before selling.

00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:22.520
On Titled, find any Ontario home on the map, and book for one flat price: $799.

00:00:22.721 --> 00:00:26.046
A licensed, independent appraiser visits the property.

00:00:27.096 --> 00:00:30.967
Then they compare it with similar homes that sold nearby, recently.

00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:35.729
You get a written report with the value and the reasons behind it.

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:38.485
The appraiser sets the value, not Titled.
